        "heading_highlight_type": "circle",
        "heading_size": 130,
        "text_content": "Structure that fits real life\n\nWeekly sessions, bite-sized check-ins, and unlimited text access keep you on track—even when you’re exhausted.\n\nYou’ll never wonder what to do next\n\nYour trainer is with you—on video, over text, in real time. No second-guessing, no waiting for the next session.\n\nWe train the human, not just the dog\n\nThis is about giving you the confidence to handle anything that comes next.\n\nIt’s built for busy people\n\nLife’s already full. This fits in quietly, effectively, and without adding chaos.\n\nDesigned for your dog—and your home\n\nBreed, age, energy level, apartment or backyard—we build your plan around the reality of your life.",
